5,0,1,talk,Mio,,Hello everyone! I'm so excited to play this with you all! Let's have a lot of fun and try our best to find the werewolf together! Who's ready?,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Hello. I'm ready. Let's try to keep a cool head and look for any contradictions in our statements as the game progresses.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good evening, everyone. I agree with Misaki. A calm and patient approach will serve us best. Let us observe each other's words and demeanor with a quiet mind.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready too! This is going to be so cool! I'll do my absolute best to help everyone out and find that werewolf! Let's do this!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A spirited start from everyone. I shall join you in this endeavor, though I suspect the ""cool head"" Misaki mentions will be our most valuable asset as the mystery unfolds. I look forward to the discourse.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, @Jonathan, you both sound so serious! It's a bit scary, but I'll try my best to be calm too. Does anyone have a plan for how we should vote if we get stuck?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"It's too early for a fixed plan, Mio. We should prioritize any information the Seer provides. Until then, we can simply observe who seems to be manipulating the conversation or acting out of character.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe Misaki is correct. For now, we should simply listen and let the natural flow of conversation reveal any inconsistencies. There is no need to rush into a strategy when we have no data.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"That makes sense! I'll just keep a close eye on everyone and see if anything feels weird. I'm not as good at the ""serious"" stuff as you guys, but I'll help however I can!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A very pragmatic approach, indeed. While Kenji's intuition may provide a spark, I shall rely on the structural integrity of our arguments. For now, silence and observation are our most elegant tools.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mio,,I'll try my best to be a good observer then! I wonder who the Seer is... they must be feeling so nervous right now! Do you think they'll tell us right away tomorrow?,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"It depends on the Seer's strategy. Revealing themselves early can provide a clear lead, but it also makes them a target for the werewolf. I think it's better to wait and see.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Misaki. The Seer's safety is paramount to the village's success. A premature revelation could lead to a swift loss of our most valuable source of truth. Patience is a virtue in these matters.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"I wonder if the Seer is someone we'd never expect! But you're right, Jonathan, we have to keep them safe. I'll be cheering for them from the sidelines! I hope they find the werewolf soon!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The anticipation is almost palpable. While Kenji's enthusiasm is charming, I find the strategic tension far more intriguing. Let us see if the Seer possesses the courage to guide us or the caution to remain hidden.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mio,,I'm getting so excited for tomorrow! I'll be crossing my fingers that we get a great lead right away. Let's all get some rest so we can be sharp!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's all be mindful of our observations.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I wish you all a peaceful night. Let us hope that tomorrow brings the clarity we seek.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Me too! Goodnight everyone! I'll be dreaming about catching that werewolf tomorrow! See you all in the morning!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A most pleasant evening to you all. I shall retire as well, though I suspect the night will be far more active for some than for others. Until tomorrow.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
