36,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all slept well! I'm so curious to see if anything happened during the night. Does anyone have any news or a lead they want to share?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Since it's the first day of voting, we should listen to see if the Seer wants to reveal their findings. If anyone has a lead, please share it now so we can analyze it logically.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I have some information to share. I am the Seer, and I divined Benjamin last night. He is human. While this doesn't identify the werewolf, it gives us a reliable starting point for our trust.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Wow, Jonathan is the Seer! That's awesome! And Benjamin is human? That's a great start! Thanks for telling us, Jonathan! Now we just have to figure out who the werewolf is!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"How very considerate of you, Jonathan. To be validated as human so early in the proceedings is quite a relief, though I must admit, your decision to reveal your identity so promptly is a bold strategic choice. I appreciate the gesture.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Jonathan, thank you for being so brave and telling us right away! That's so helpful! Since Benjamin is safe, that means the werewolf is one of the rest of us... oh no, that's actually kind of scary!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Jonathan, while your claim is helpful, we must consider the possibility that the werewolf is pretending to be the Seer to gain trust. However, if you are genuine, we have a solid foundation. Does anyone else feel suspicious?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I understand your caution, Misaki. It is a necessary part of the game. For now, I ask that you trust my word. I believe we should observe how the others react to this information before we cast our votes.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I agree with Jonathan! He's being so helpful by telling us right away. @Misaki, I know you're being careful, but let's try to trust him! Does anyone else feel like someone is acting weird?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a delicate balance, is it not? Kenji's optimism is refreshing, yet Misaki's skepticism is the very shield that protects us. I find myself wondering if the werewolf is currently enjoying this internal friction.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm wondering that too, Benjamin! It's like a puzzle! @Misaki, do you still think Jonathan might be lying? I really want to believe him because it makes things so much easier! What do you guys think?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Misaki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I don't ""want"" to believe or disbelieve; I simply want the truth. If Jonathan is the Seer, we have a clear path. If he is the werewolf, he has just successfully cleared Benjamin. We should look for any contradictions in how others are reacting.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I appreciate your commitment to the truth, Misaki. It is the only way to ensure the village's safety. I invite you all to consider if my revelation serves the werewolf's interests or if it provides the clarity we need to move forward.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I think Jonathan is telling the truth! Why would the werewolf make Benjamin safe? That doesn't seem right! I'm with Jonathan and Benjamin on this one. Let's try to find the real bad guy together!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Kenji's logic is a fascinating point of contention. While clearing a villager may seem counterintuitive for a werewolf, it is a classic maneuver to build an aura of credibility. However, the risk of a counter-claim is high. I remain cautiously optimistic about Jonathan's honesty.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm starting to feel a bit nervous! If we can't decide, we might accidentally vote out a nice person. But since everyone seems to trust Jonathan, maybe we should look at who's being the most quiet? I'll follow the group!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"We have no concrete evidence against anyone yet. If we trust Jonathan's divination, we have two humans. Between Mio and Kenji, neither has shown any contradictions. I suggest we skip today to avoid a mistake.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree with Misaki. Since we have no direct evidence of the werewolf's identity, a mistake today would be a heavy loss for the village. Let us be patient and wait for more information. I suggest we skip.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I agree! I don't want to accidentally vote out a friend. Let's be patient and wait for more clues! I'll vote to skip too!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Skip"",""tail"":""Skip!""}]}"
55,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A most sensible conclusion. To execute a fellow villager on a whim would be a tragedy of the highest order, and a gift to the werewolf. I shall join you all in voting to skip.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
56,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
