70,2,1,talk,Mio,,Oh no! I can't believe it! Jonathan is gone! He was the Seer and he was trying so hard to help us! This is just terrible! Who could have done such a thing?,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Misaki,,It is a significant loss. The werewolf targeted Jonathan specifically because he was the Seer and a threat. This confirms that Jonathan was likely telling the truth about his role and Benjamin's status. We must now rely on that information.,"{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"This is so sad! Poor Jonathan! He was so brave to tell us everything, and now he's gone! We have to make sure his help wasn't for nothing! We have to find the werewolf now!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, a tragedy. The werewolf's choice of target is the most honest piece of evidence we have received thus far. By eliminating the Seer, the enemy has attempted to blind us, but in doing so, they have inadvertently validated Jonathan's claim.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, @Benjamin, you're right! Since Jonathan was the Seer, we know for sure that Benjamin is human! That's a huge relief. But now we're in trouble... who do we trust? Does anyone feel like someone is acting suspicious?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Benjamin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"We have Benjamin as a confirmed human, which leaves Mio, Kenji, and myself. Since the werewolf is among us, we must be extremely careful. @Mio, @Kenji, do you have any observations about our behavior so far?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Mio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"I've been thinking about it, and everyone has been so nice! It's really hard to say. But @Misaki, you're always so logical and careful... maybe that's a way to hide something? No, that's probably not it! I'm just guessing!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Kenji, your intuition is as erratic as a weathercock, though I admire the spirit. While Misaki's logic is a shield, it could indeed be a mask. However, we must ask: who benefits most from the Seer's silence?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,3,talk,Mio,,"That's a scary question, Benjamin! I guess the werewolf benefits the most because we can't get any more divinations. But I'm just a regular girl, I'm not good at this! @Misaki, do you have any ideas?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"The werewolf benefits most, as Benjamin said. Since we have no more divinations, we must rely on behavioral analysis. @Kenji, you've been very enthusiastic, but your sudden suspicion of me feels a bit deflective. What do you think, Benjamin?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, deflective?! I was just thinking out loud! I'm sorry if it sounded weird, Misaki! I just want us to be super careful because the werewolf is still here! I'm not trying to hide anything, I promise!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
81,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The tension is mounting, is it not? Kenji's apology is heartfelt, yet Misaki's observation is logically sound. In this game, a sudden shift in focus can be a clumsy attempt to divert suspicion. I find myself intrigued by this friction.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
82,2,4,talk,Mio,,"I don't like seeing everyone argue! We should be working together to honor Jonathan's memory! @Kenji, please don't be sad, and @Misaki, I'm sure Kenji didn't mean it in a bad way. Maybe we should just vote for the person who seems most nervous?","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Kenji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
83,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"Voting based on nervousness is too subjective, Mio. We need to be precise. Kenji's behavior is inconsistent, but we must also consider the Possessed. If we execute the wrong person, the werewolf wins. I'm leaning toward Kenji, but I'm not certain.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
84,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, you're leaning toward me?! Misaki, that's not fair! I've been trying to help everyone this whole time! I'm just a kid, I don't know how to be ""consistent"" like you guys! Please, you can't really think I'm the bad guy!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
85,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A poignant plea, Kenji. However, in this theater of deception, innocence is often the most convincing costume. Misaki's suspicion is rooted in logic, while your defense is rooted in emotion. I find the contrast quite telling. Let us weigh these perspectives carefully.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
